{"title":"Career Roadmap · Market Research Analyst","role":"Market Research Analyst","summary":"A Market Research Analyst uses statistics, research methodology, consumer data and business analysis to understand markets, customers, competitors and demand patterns.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science - General / Honours)","Course":"Statistics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Market Research Analyst uses statistics, research methodology, consumer data and business analysis to understand markets, customers, competitors and demand patterns."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Designing surveys"},{"text":"Collecting primary and secondary data"},{"text":"Sampling respondents"},{"text":"Cleaning datasets"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Consumer segmentation"},{"text":"Market sizing"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Trend analysis"},{"text":"Customer behavior analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Preparing dashboards and reports"},{"text":"Translating statistical findings into business recommendations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Sc Statistics graduate, the strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Statistics","Market Research","Survey Methodology","SQL","Python/R","Consumer Analytics","Data Visualization","Business Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Career Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Statistics","Probability + Statistical Inference","Survey Research + Sampling","Data Cleaning + Statistical Analysis","Excel + SQL + Python/R","Consumer + Market Analysis","Research Project / Internship","Research Analyst / Market Research Analyst","Senior Market Research Analyst","Research Consultant / Insights Analyst","Market Intelligence Manager","Research / Insights Director"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"